6. SUB-AGENT DESIGN RULES
==================================================

Do not make every node an LLM call.

Use LLM-backed nodes only where reasoning is needed:
- intent classification
- SQL / aggregation generation
- explanation
- recommendation

Use deterministic nodes for:
- auth
- permission loading
- policy checks
- credential selection
- execution
- audit logging
- approval creation
- environment restrictions
- read-only detection
- validation wrappers where possible

Separate reasoning from enforcement.
Security must never depend only on prompt instructions.

